  "description": "Discover this spacious and elegant 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom apartment located in the sought-after urbanisation of Las Mimosas, Marbella. Designed for comfort and relaxation, the property offers generous living spaces and a large private terrace overlooking the lush gardens and stunning communal pool—perfect for enjoying the Mediterranean lifestyle.\n\nIdeally situated in a secure gated community, this apartment is just a 2-minute walk from the beach, making it perfect for both holidaymakers and long-term residents. The location also offers easy walking access to San Pedro and the vibrant Puerto Banús, where you’ll find a wide selection of restaurants, shops, and entertainment.\n\nResidents can enjoy excellent on-site facilities, including a large outdoor swimming pool, as well as a luxurious indoor pool complete with jacuzzi and sauna—ideal for year-round enjoyment.\n\nWhether you’re looking for a relaxing getaway or a convenient base in Marbella, this apartment offers the perfect combination of location, comfort, and lifestyle.\n\nPlease note that we welcome families and couples only, no groups under 30, and no hen or stag parties. Should you fall outside of this category but wish to book nonetheless, please send us an enquiry detailing a bit more about yourself and the group that you will be travelling with so we can request this for you.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you!",
